// GDTF grimdark UI theme — data-driven (ADR 0003).
//
// Ported faithfully from the Godot source theme (ui/theme/main_theme.tres):
// colors, border, content margins, font size, and the loose font key below
// match the original exactly. Colors are non-premultiplied sRGB quads
// (r, g, b, a), each channel in 0.0..=1.0. Resolved into the runtime GdtfTheme
// by GdtfThemeSpec::resolve (see crates/gdtf_ui/src/theme.rs).
//
// hover_bg / press_bg are PORT-INTRODUCED: the Godot theme had no hover/press
// state colors. They are slightly-lifted variants of panel_bg — hover lighter
// than press, both visibly distinct from the base fill.
(
    text:             (0.84, 0.80, 0.73, 1.0),
    panel_bg:         (0.08, 0.08, 0.10, 0.96),
    border_color:     (0.20, 0.20, 0.24, 1.0),
    border_width_px:  1.0,
    corner_radius_px: 2.0,
    margin_left_px:   8.0,
    margin_right_px:  8.0,
    margin_top_px:    6.0,
    margin_bottom_px: 6.0,
    font_size_pt:     18.0,
    font_key:         "fonts/Alegreya-Variable.ttf",
    hover_bg:         (0.16, 0.16, 0.19, 0.96),
    press_bg:         (0.12, 0.12, 0.15, 0.96),
)
